{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281200","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1028120001:1":{"text":"That was a close call, but we're alright, thanks to you.","source_cn":"刚才很危险，多亏有你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC541C8057FB630A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028120002:1":{"text":"Let me absorb the last of my lost magic and my final memory. ","source_cn":"让我把逸散的魔力完全吸收，看完最后的回忆吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE457F056E914DA3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1028120002":{"text":"Let me absorb the last of my lost magic and my final memory. ","source_cn":"让我把逸散的魔力完全吸收，看完最后的回忆吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE457F056E914DA3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028120003:0":{"text":"Hewynn, have you thought of venturing out? Hmm... if I was asked to, I'd hesitate as well. ","source_cn":"伊温，你没想好要不要出去吗？嗯……这个问题要是问我的话...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3E69E5E4A8354BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028120004:0":{"text":"Florabelle, I... I want to stay here forever and help all creatures of the Taran River. ","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔，我……我想永远留在这里，帮助所有塔兰河抚育的生灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9F032159DC874AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028120005:0":{"text":"Am I... weak? ","source_cn":"我是不是……很没出息？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39242CA83D189A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028120006:0":{"text":"How could that be? Wherever you are, your strength manifests in your gentle raindrops. ","source_cn":"怎么会呢？无论在哪里，你的力量都会化成温柔的雨滴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E0EF71E6333EB71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028120007:0":{"text":"If they land on Lovers' Wish, they'll nurture the wildlife there, and if they fall into the Taran River, they'll drift and spread into the distance. ","source_cn":"落在情人之愿，就能滋润这里的花草；落在水中，就会随着塔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF63133A9C7CD9CE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028120008:0":{"text":"Hewynn, you're amazing. You know what you want most, and you go after it, which also takes courage! ","source_cn":"伊温，这样很好呀！你知道自己最想要的是什么，这也是一种勇气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD92E9BAC01D26864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028120009:0":{"text":"I have... courage? ","source_cn":"我……勇气？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E40B20D0F415817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028120010:0":{"text":"Of course! It's brave to venture into the unknown but just as courageous to look within your heart and go for what you want.","source_cn":"当然了！面对陌生和危险，大胆向前，这是勇气；但直面内心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4593EBA8AC6FCF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028120011:0":{"text":"Hewynn, you are braver than you know. ","source_cn":"伊温，你比你想象中更加勇敢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC194B998D95CB88D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028120012:0":{"text":"Florabelle, thank you...","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔，谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF53D6E827C0761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028120013:0":{"text":"So this was Hewynn's real memory.","source_cn":"原来……这才是伊温小姐真正的回忆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14F3722BD3EB402D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028120014:1":{"text":"I've received many kind words from people, but this is the first time I've been called courageous. ","source_cn":"我听过许多不同的赞美，可那是第一次有人说我“有勇气”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x787051403D7C9D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028120015:0":{"text":"From Florabelle, I learned that bravery is not only facing dangers from the outside world, but having the will to face myself. ","source_cn":"从芙拉贝尔那里我才知道，勇气不光是敢于挑战外界的危险，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x600FBD19BB69F15C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028120016:0":{"text":"Apologies... I can't linger on these memories. Please wait, I'll finish reclaiming my magic soon. ","source_cn":"抱歉……我总是忍不住沉浸在回忆中。请稍等，我马上就能将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB54E1BCFB1C7D77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"(Activate the Memory Fragment again)","source_cn":"再次激活记忆碎片","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B5F4FC5E18C6BA0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(Activate the Memory Fragment again)","female":"(Activate the Memory Fragment again)","variant_male_record_index":"61676","variant_female_record_index":"61677","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"Hewynn","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:回忆中的芙拉贝尔":{"text":"Florabelle","source":"回忆中的芙拉贝尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:回忆中的伊温":{"text":"Hewynn","source":"回忆中的伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":4}}